<title>THAILAND: Thai April trade deficit widens to 41.0 bln baht.</title>
<headline>Thai April trade deficit widens to 41.0 bln baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand said on Thursday Thailand's trade deficit widened to 41.0 billion baht in April from 22.2 billion in March and against 51.1 billion a year ago.</p>
<p>    MERCHANDISE TRADE    April 97     March 97     April 96</p>
<p>	  Exports		110.3	 126.9	  104.8</p>
<p>	  Imports		151.4	 149.1	  155.9</p>
<p>	  Trade balance	 -41.0	-22.2	  -51.1</p>
<p>Note - Figures in billions of baht.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok Newsroom (662)-652-0642</p>
</text>
